    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE HIGH COURT OF THE PROVINCES(SPECIAL PROVISIONS) ACT, NO. 19 OF 1990",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      257.33,
      401.9,
      279.59
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      290.33,
      401.86,
      323.63
    ],
    "text": "1. (1) This Act may be cited as the High Court of theProvinces (Special Provisions) (Amendment) Act, No. of2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      334.25,
      401.9,
      367.67
    ],
    "text": "(2) The provisions of this Act shall come into operationon such date as the Minister may appoint by Order publishedin the Gazette.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      378.29,
      401.88,
      411.59
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 5A of the High Court of the Provinces (SpecialProvisions) Act, No. 19 of 1990 is hereby amended asfollows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      422.33,
      401.94,
      488.63
    ],
    "text": "(1)in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution for thewords \u201cDistrict Court or a Family Court\u201d, of thewords \u201cDistrict Court, Family Court or Small ClaimsCourt\u201d and for the words \u201c District Court or FamilyCourt\u201d, of the words \u201cof a District Court, of a FamilyCourt or of a Small Claims Court\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      499.25,
      401.88,
      554.63
    ],
    "text": "(2)in subsection (2) thereof, by the substitution for thewords \u201cof a District Court or a Family Court,\u201d, ofthe words \u201cof a District Court, of a Family Court orof a Small Claims Court,\u201d wherever they occur inthat subsection; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      565.25,
      401.88,
      609.14
    ],
    "text": "(3)in the marginal note to that section by thesubstitution for the words \u201cDistrict Courts and FamilyCourts.\u201d, of the words \u201cDistrict Courts, Family Courtsand Small Claims Courts.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      620.33,
      401.9,
      643.31
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
